xe_xml2json.xxe_xml2json"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"DOM-derived text is written back to the page as HTML. The value read from the DOM (or the URL) reaches an HTML interpretation sink such as innerHTML, outerHTML, insertAdjacentHTML or document.write, which results in DOM Cross Site Scripting. Sanitize the value with DOMPurify.sanitize() before writing it, or assign it with textContent so that it is never parsed as HTML."},"help":{"markdown":"DOM-derived text is written back to the page as HTML. The value read from the DOM (or the URL) reaches an HTML interpretation sink such as innerHTML, outerHTML, insertAdjacentHTML or document.write, which results in DOM Cross Site Scripting. Sanitize the value with DOMPurify.sanitize() before writing it, or assign it with textContent so that it is never parsed as HTML.\n\n#### 💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at <a href='https://sg.run/pro'>sg.run/pro</a>\n\n<b>References:</b>\n - [Semgrep Rule](https://semgrep.dev/r/ajinabraham.njsscan.xss.xss_dom.dom_xss)\n","text":"DOM-derived text is written back to the page as HTML. The value read from the DOM (or the URL) reaches an HTML interpretation sink such as innerHTML, outerHTML, insertAdjacentHTML or document.write, which results in DOM Cross Site Scripting. Sanitize the value with DOMPurify.sanitize() before writing it, or assign it with textContent so that it is never parsed as HTML.\n💎 Enable cross-file analysis and Pro rules for free at sg.run/pro"},"helpUri":"https://semgrep.dev/r/ajinabraham.njsscan.xss.xss_dom.dom_xss","id":"ajinabraham.njsscan.xss.xss_dom.dom_xss","name":"ajinabraham.njsscan.xss.xss_dom.dom_xss","properties":{"precision":"very-high","tags":["cwe-79","security"]},"shortDescription":{"text":"Semgrep Finding: ajinabraham.njsscan.xss.xss_dom.dom_xss"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"Markup escaping disabled. This can be used with some template engines to esca